{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51336","headline":"秋疾初愈月夜咏左思招隐诗因而成咏 · 权德舆","name":"秋疾初愈月夜咏左思招隐诗因而成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲吟理轻步，不厌凉夜咏。\n断续风际声，清羸月中影。\n萤光拂花露，泉脉连桐井。\n心畅百虑销，境条万籁静。\n前贤有遗韵，顾我三日省。\n朗怀方自怡，星河渐耿耿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}